| SSE | Social or Behavioral Science Elective from UCGS1 | 3 |
| MTH 161 or MTH 263 | Precalculus I or Calculus I | 3-4 |
| CSC 221 | Introduction to Problem Solving and Programming | 3 |
| | **Total** | 16-17 |

