| | **Total** | 16-17 |

**Third Semester (Fall)**

| **Course Number** | **Course Title** | **Credits** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| CSC 222 | Object-oriented Programming | 4 |
| MTH 263 or MTH 265 | Calculus I or Calculus III | 4 |
| CSC 208/MTH 288 | Introduction to Discrete Structures/Discrete Mathematics | 3 |
